{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "upwork-workflow-generator", "elements": [{"id": "rectangle_25", "type": "rectangle", "x": -104, "y": -75, "width": 700, "height": 283, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9db7e6", "backgroundColor": "#e7f0fd", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1048386556, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 351564608, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_26", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": -59, "width": 656, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e4f9c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1289560150, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2126508551, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 - CAPTURE LINE-ITEM PROPERTIES AND METAFIELDS", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "1 - CAPTURE LINE-ITEM PROPERTIES AND METAFIELDS", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_27", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": -23, "width": 656, "height": 81, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1475216846, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1927728187, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Your Custom Integration & Data Architecture, the sync and the mapping: Shopify's order\nwebhooks feed Make directly, so the native integration's limits never apply. One Shopify\ncall pulls every line-item property and metafield, which steps 4a, 5 and 8 map onto your\nContact, Deal and Line Item properties. Engraving Text, Font and Gift Wrap stand in for your\nown line-item property names until you send the real list.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Your Custom Integration & Data Architecture, the sync and the mapping: Shopify's order\nwebhooks feed Make directly, so the native integration's limits never apply. One Shopify\ncall pulls every line-item property and metafield, which steps 4a, 5 and 8 map onto your\nContact, Deal and Line Item properties. Engraving Text, Font and Gift Wrap stand in for your\nown line-item property names until you send the real list.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_28", "type": "rectangle", "x": 796, "y": -122, "width": 1048, "height": 490, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9fd1a8", "backgroundColor": "#e8f6ea", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1236683273, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 314395343, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_29", "type": "text", "x": 818, "y": -106, "width": 1004, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1f6b30", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 507088657, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1795823849, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 - NO DUPLICATE CONTACTS OR CORRUPTED DEALS", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "2 - NO DUPLICATE CONTACTS OR CORRUPTED DEALS", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_30", "type": "text", "x": 818, "y": -71, "width": 1004, "height": 49, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 708506837, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1469118511, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Your clean data handling: step 3 looks up the Shopify order ID before any deal is made, step 4a matches the contact on email, and\nshopify_order_id is set to unique values in HubSpot. If the native HubSpot app stays installed, its deal sync needs to be off, or orders can\nland as two deals.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Your clean data handling: step 3 looks up the Shopify order ID before any deal is made, step 4a matches the contact on email, and\nshopify_order_id is set to unique values in HubSpot. If the native HubSpot app stays installed, its deal sync needs to be off, or orders can\nland as two deals.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_31", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2042, "y": -138, "width": 1396, "height": 346, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c7a6e3", "backgroundColor": "#f3e9fb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 652768598, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2100080515, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_32", "type": "text", "x": 2064, "y": -122, "width": 1352, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5b2c8c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1811180650, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 168393880, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 - OPTIONS FOR YOUR EMAIL TOKENS AND ABANDONED CHECKOUT", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "3 - OPTIONS FOR YOUR EMAIL TOKENS AND ABANDONED CHECKOUT", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_33", "type": "text", "x": 2064, "y": -87, "width": 1352, "height": 65, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 333377415, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1347535309, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Your Automated HubSpot Workflows & Personalization and Email Template Setup: the deal carries the order's options and the contact its last-order tokens and product image, which your\npost-purchase, upsell and re-engagement sequences and drag-and-drop templates pull in. Abandoned checkout runs as its own scenario on Shopify's checkout webhook, and only checkouts with\nan email that were never completed get through: the cart's options and recovery link land on the contact, so your abandoned cart sequence shows the options they picked, and a completed\norder clears the link. Step 6 sends the deal ID back to the order for the two-way sync.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Your Automated HubSpot Workflows & Personalization and Email Template Setup: the deal carries the order's options and the contact its last-order tokens and product image, which your\npost-purchase, upsell and re-engagement sequences and drag-and-drop templates pull in. Abandoned checkout runs as its own scenario on Shopify's checkout webhook, and only checkouts with\nan email that were never completed get through: the cart's options and recovery link land on the contact, so your abandoned cart sequence shows the options they picked, and a completed\norder clears the link. Step 6 sends the deal ID back to the order for the two-way sync.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_34", "type": "rectangle", "x": 3638, "y": -138, "width": 700, "height": 266, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e6c97a", "backgroundColor": "#fff5df", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1460814403, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1504004732, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_35", "type": "text", "x": 3660, "y": -122, "width": 656, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8a5a00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2133201996, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1959386987, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4 - EVERY OPTION ON ITS LINE ITEM FOR REPORTING", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "4 - EVERY OPTION ON ITS LINE ITEM FOR REPORTING", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_36", "type": "text", "x": 3660, "y": -87, "width": 656, "height": 65, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 295334610, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 401991736, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Your Analytics & Custom Reporting: each line item keeps its own option and metafield values\nbeside the deal's revenue and the contact's lifetime spend, the fields your dashboards group\nby for revenue, CLV and sales by product option variation. Line items with custom properties\ndo this without HubSpot custom objects.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Your Analytics & Custom Reporting: each line item keeps its own option and metafield values\nbeside the deal's revenue and the contact's lifetime spend, the fields your dashboards group\nby for revenue, CLV and sales by product option variation. Line items with custom properties\ndo this without HubSpot custom objects.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_1", "type": "rectangle", "x": -68, "y": 88, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2d6a4f", "backgroundColor": "#b7e4c7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1390851129, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 647892280, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_2"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_37"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_2", "type": "text", "x": -56.0, "y": 111.25, "width": 256, "height": 38, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1695753999, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 207388625, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 - Shopify Order Created or\nUpdated: Webhook Fires", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_1", "originalText":